  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in the fondue pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute, until fragrant.",
    "Add the matcha powder and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the chicken broth, lemon juice, salt, and black pepper, and bring to a simmer.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and let simmer for 5 minutes.",
    "Add the grated cheese and stir until melted and smooth.",
    "Add the chopped basil and stir to combine.",
    "Cook the pasta according to package instructions and drain.",
    "Add the cooked pasta to the fondue pot and toss to coat with the silky sauce.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy."
